  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana Bongo district vulnerable women income generating project through community needs based vocational training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The lack of vocational training facilities in Bongo, high tuition fees, long-term apprenticeships, and heavy domestic burdens highly limit women&apos;s opportunities to learn vocational skills. In addition, few numbers of markets, low levels of women&apos;s business skills, and lack of starts up funds create obstacles for women to have a business. These limited opportunities for vocational training and business make women have low incomes. In this regard, this project will establish vocational training centres and provide vocational training to build up capacity for women. In particular, this project will create and operate the child care space for women who have children. Furthermore, this project will provide business and literacy training and vitalize savings group activities to expand the business opportunities for women. Ultimately, it is expected to see an increase in Bongo women&apos;s income.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to increase the income of vulnerable women in Bongo region of Ghana by providing vocational training, enhancing business skills, and establishing vocational training centers. This initiative aims to empower women, improve their econonic status, and promote sustainable development within the community.&#xbd09;&#xace0; &#xc9d5;&#xaca8; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xc758; &#xc9c1;&#xc5c5;&#xae30;&#xc220; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xbd09;&#xace0;&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc5ec;&#xc131;&#xc758; &#xbe44;&#xc988;&#xb2c8;&#xc2a4; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xd655;&#xb300;</narrative>
  </description>
